@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
title Civic Issue Tracker - Activity Diagram: Issue Resolution Workflow

|Citizen|
start
:Register / log in;
:Fill report form
(title, sector, category,
description, location);
|System|
:Record initial status
history (Reported);
note right
  Every status change (initial report and each
  transition) appends a timestamped entry to
  the status history with actor and comment,
  as implemented in api/issues.py.
end note
while (Input valid?) is (no)
  :Show validation errors;
  |Citizen|
  :Correct and resubmit;
  |System|
endwhile (yes)
:Store issue;
:Save image if provided;
:Generate public ID;
:Notify reporter and admins;
|Administrator|
:Review report;
if (Accept?) then (reject)
  :Set Rejected with reason;
  |System|
  :Record status history;
  :Notify citizen of rejection;
  stop
else (accept)
  if (Needs clarification?) then (yes)
    :Add admin comment;
    |System|
    :Notify citizen;
    |Administrator|
    :Wait for citizen reply;
  else (no)
  endif
  :Assign to department
  (and staff if available);
  :Set status Under Review;
  |System|
  :Record status history;
endif
|Department Staff|
:Start work;
:Set status In Progress;
|System|
:Record status history;
|Department Staff|
:Resolve issue on site;
:Set status Resolved
with resolution note;
|System|
:Record status history;
:Notify citizen of resolution;
|Administrator|
:Review resolution;
if (Accept resolution?) then (no)
  :Reopen (In Progress)
  with comment;
  |System|
  :Record status history;
  :Notify citizen and staff;
  |Department Staff|
  :Rework the issue;
  :Set status Resolved;
  |System|
  :Record status history;
else (yes)
endif
|Citizen|
:View resolution
and full history;
stop
@enduml
